# Real (anonymized) sample exports used to validate the parsers — never
# commit real patient/device exports, even anonymized ones. No trailing
# slash: the KMP port's worktree links these in as symlinks (the real dirs
# live only in the main checkout, since worktrees only carry tracked
# files), and a slash-terminated pattern doesn't match a symlink.
test/abbott_logfiles
test/boston bnk
test/microport xml
test/medtronic pdd files
test/Biotronik xml
test/medtronic pkg

# Same policy for the KMP port's fixture-validation test data: these JSON
# files are derived from (and contain extracted fields/raw text out of) the
# real sample exports above — device serials, printable-string dumps, etc.
# Regenerate locally via the scripts in core/scripts/ before running the
# fixture-cross-validation tests.
core/src/desktopTest/resources/*.json
test/medtronic pkg/

